CHAPTER.VERS:
Their land also is full of silver and gold, neither 
        end of their treasures; their land is also full of horses, neither 
        end of their chariots:

In that day a man shall cast his idols of silver, and his idols of gold, which they made  for himself to worship, to the moles and to the bats; 

          his idols of silver…: Heb. the idols of his silver, etc



          each…: or, for him
